# Archive Output Location

- Place all generated or moved archive artifacts in `/data/tyewhong/qagredo/`.
- This applies to:
  - `*.tar`
  - `*.tar.gz`
  - `*.tar.gz.sha256`
- Do not keep these archive artifacts in `/home/tyewhong/qagredo/` after creation.
- When providing commands, default output paths should target `/data/tyewhong/qagredo/`.
- When the same archive filename exists in both locations, replace the `/data/tyewhong/qagredo/` copy only if the source in `/home/tyewhong/qagredo/offline_out/` is newer.
